# Shell scripts must be LF in every checkout, whatever each clone's
# core.autocrlf happens to be. A CR left in the shebang or in a command line
# makes sh fail with a misleading "not found" - which is precisely how the
# first production start-up broke. apps/api/start.sh now gates the container's
# entrypoint, so this is load-bearing.
*.sh text eol=lf
